sequenceDiagram
  actor Ex as Executive Committee
  actor St as Staff
  participant AG as staff-agenda.html
  participant RS as Resolution service
  participant EO as e-Office
  participant N as Email + System To-Do
  Ex->>AG: Select resolution per proposal (อนุมัติ / มีเงื่อนไข / ไม่อนุมัติ) + approved amount
  AG->>RS: validate amount ≤ min(request, tier cap), reason required for conditions/reject
  RS-->>AG: statuses updated (Approved / Rejected)
  St->>AG: Select proposals, click "ตรวจร่างและลงนามประกาศ"
  AG->>RS: previewAnnouncement(ids)
  RS-->>AG: draft announcement (approved list, total)
  St->>AG: Confirm review, sign
  AG->>EO: send for e-Office signing
  EO-->>AG: signed, announcement no.
  AG->>N: notify every researcher (Email + To-Do)
  N-->>St: delivery summary
